    "detailed_description": "Minesweeper is back, with an arcade twist!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy 50 unique levels, designed to challenge even the smartest players.<br />\r\nRace against the clock in arcade mode, or take your time in casual mode.<br />\r\nRelive the suspense and excitement of old-school minesweeper in classic mode.<br />\r\nPlay the standard minesweeper board sizes or create your own custom boards.<br />\r\nAvoid sticky situations using hints to eliminate guesswork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarn achievements by beating arcade levels and completing classic minesweeper boards quickly.<br />\r\nCompete against the world's greatest minesweepers by setting high scores on global leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready? Let's play Minesweeper Arcade!",
